      (a p.1) (b p.1) (c p.1) (δ p.1) p.2))

theorem measurableSet_cornerReservoir_family {X : Type*} [MeasurableSpace X]
    {I : Set (X × ℝ)} (hI : MeasurableSet I) {a b c δ : X → ℝ}
